OL,3,A'She slipped out of my hand' - couple's
OL,4,Achildren missing after ferry capsizes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAyten Bicer felt her 12-year-old
OL,7,Fdaughter slip from her grasp and
OL,8,Fdisappear as the ferry they were
OL,9,Ftravelling on capsized off the coast of
OL,10,Fnorthern Cyprus on Sunday, killing
OL,11,Feight people.
OL,13,FHer daughter Miray and six-year-old son
OL,14,FMemhet Asaf are among 20 people still
OL,15,Fmissing after the vessel sunk while en
OL,16,Froute to Turkey from the coastal town
OL,17,Fof Kyrenia, in the self-proclaimed
OL,18,FTurkish republic on Cyprus.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
