OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'She slipped out of my hand' - couple's
OL,4,Achildren missing after ferry capsizes
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe and her husband, Hayri, survived
OL,7,Fand, like many other families, are
OL,8,Fwaiting for news of their loved ones
OL,9,Fback in port as rescuers continue to
OL,10,Fsearch.
OL,12,F"She was saying, 'Don't let go'. And I
OL,13,Fdidn't let go of my daughter. I swear,
OL,14,FI didn't let her go," Bicer told
OL,15,Freporters through tears.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
